createbedrock.guide.page.arm.mechanical_arm_setup.title=mechanical arm/setup
createbedrock.guide.page.arm.mechanical_arm_setup.body=Goal: reproduce mechanical_arm/setup.\n\n1. Gather the blocks shown by this Create family.\n2. Build and power the arrangement.\n3. Observe the expected setup behavior.\n\nIf it does not run, inspect speed, stress, filters, and available inventory with Engineer's Goggles.
